      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiryat_Motzkin",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hai‑Park, opened in 2002, is Israel’s first zoo that doubles as a conservation and education center, housing animals in realistic habitats.",
